text:
Yari ang Instrumental Intensities:

Intensity III – Bolinao and Bani, PANGASINAN; Sinait and City of Vigan, ILOCOS SUR; Bontoc, MOUNTAIN PROVINCE;

Intensity II – City Laoag, ILOCOS NORTE; Candon and Narvacan, ILOCOS SUR; Bangar, LA UNION; CITY OF DAGUPAN; Urdaneta and Lingayen, PANGASINAN;

Intensity I – Dinalupihan and Orani, BATAAN; CITY OF BAGUIO; Obando and Calumpit, BULACAN; Claveria, CAGAYAN; San Nicolas, ILOCOS NORTE; Tagudin, ILOCOS SUR; CITY OF MALABON; Guagua, PAMPANGA; Umingan and Sison, PANGASINAN; Ramos and Bamban, TARLAC; Subic, Iba, Masinloc, San Marcelino, and Cabangan, ZAMBALES

Posible ang aftershocks suno pa sa Phivolcs.#

